 I had thought that I should have one module for fetching instructions and a second one for defered memory access.  But both need access to the ram so they should be merged.

 So this module assess ram.  It contains the pc an address mux that takes the pc and an effective address.  It contains logic to do the incrementing/ decrementing of the auto index locations.  It contains logic to do the INC /DCR instructiosn of memory.
 It contains logic to do chained indirect address calcuations as well as placing limits on the number of indirections.

 It contains logic to do subroutine calls (return address in AC3)

 it might contain stack operations

 
